  "_comment": "ARCHITECTURE §7.1's session-clock mapping, §7.2's LEAD = max(120ms, 4 x rtt_p95) and PROTOCOL §5 rule 2's schedule-or-apply-immediately decision. Every value is monotonic or session microseconds; nothing here has ever seen a wall clock. Generated by tools/generate_session_clock_vectors.py — an independent third transcription of the arithmetic. Edit the generator, never this file.",
